### Día 1 — Catálogo reactivo
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Lista como array JSON
GET {{host}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Lista en streaming (NDJSON: un JSON por línea)
GET {{host}}/api/products
Accept: application/x-ndjson

### Filtro por categoría
GET {{host}}/api/products?category=perifericos

### Un producto
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Producto inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/products/no-existe

### Crear -> 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Webcam HD",
  "category": "perifericos",
  "price": 39.90,
  "stock": 12
}

### Crear inválido -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "perifericos",
  "price": -1,
  "stock": 1
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/products/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Auriculares Pro",
  "category": "audio",
  "price": 79.00,
  "stock": 30
}

### Borrar -> 204 (repetir -> 404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/5

### Server-Sent Events (mejor desde el navegador: http://localhost:8080)
GET {{host}}/api/products/prices
Accept: text/event-stream

### Modelo de hilos
GET {{host}}/api/demo/non-blocking?ms=2000

###
GET {{host}}/api/demo/blocking?ms=2000

###
GET {{host}}/api/demo/offloaded?ms=2000

### Beans especiales del DispatcherHandler
GET {{host}}/internals/dispatcher

### Rutas registradas (Actuator)
GET {{host}}/actuator/mappings
